Dear All,

A fair bit of IIO related discussion was occurring off list and with
increasing amounts of driver development it was decided a specific
list would be useful.

To that end we now have

linux-iio@vger.kernel.org

subscribe by sending an email with a body of

subscribe linux-iio

to majordomo@vger.kernel.org

archive at:

http://marc.info/?l=linux-iio&r=1&w=2

Thanks to David and Hank for setting these up.

For now any more general discussions should be posted to both linux-iio
and LKML.  The principal aim of this list is to ensure that discussions
of more specific issues are available to anyone interested.

Thanks,

Jonathan

